    {
      "game": "Turbo Overkill",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/16669/450x258/turbo-overkill-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1791039600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/16669-buy-turbo-overkill-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "SambaL",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/27742514-1746025891.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "It's alright as far as 'boomer shooters' go, though I'd say there's better stuff out there. Maybe because the generic cyberpunk theme didn't really speak to me personally. Anywho, It's pretty cheap (here) so you'll get a lot of bang for your 3 bucks or so, but try the demo first just in case."
    },
    {
      "game": "Vertigo 2",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/22171/450x258/vertigo-2-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1791039600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/22171-buy-vertigo-2-pc-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-254a9bc",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "The BEST VR game i have ever played in my life! I played it for 13 hours and just beat the game. I just can't believe that it's made by one person. And can i not overstate how good this game is. It's my favorite VR game and i played BoneLab, Half-Life Alyx, TW S&S and Into The Radius 2. If you want to buy it this is your sign. This game is really cheap too! In conclusion buy it buy it now!"
    },
    {
      "game": "Resonance: A Plague Tale Legacy",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/19517/450x258/resonance-a-plague-tale-legacy-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1791039600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/19517-buy-resonance-a-plague-tale-legacy-pc-steam/",
      "user": "SpurEisvogel70",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/31391545-1778429197.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Ein wirklich sehr gutes Spiel allerdings absolut nicht das was ich erwartet habe..\n\n\n\nDie Grafik licht etc ist fantastisch, die Story ist gut wenn auch sehr bei den Haaren herbeigezogen. Anfangs viele Rätsel die auch nicht zu schwer waren.. bis das Spiel nach ungefähr 3 h schon fast zu einem horror Spiel wird. Das Kampf System ist zum Glück recht einfach gehalten, die Kämpfe gehören zur Story gehen aber sonst eher auf die Nerven wenn man sich auf die Geschichte einlässt ist man in 9 bis 10 Stunden durch. Leider absolut keinen wieder Spiel wert einmal durchspielen und dann wird's deinstalliert"
    }
  ],
